    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d33">

                <pb facs="0084" n="74" xml:id="pg74"/>

                <head>Mr. Adams to Mr.
                        Seward.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 570.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United
                                States,</hi><hi rendition="#italic"> London,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-01-08"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >January</hi> 8, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have now to report the reception of
                    another note from Lord Russell in relation to the case of Ralph Cator, already
                    acted upon, as mentioned by me in my despatch (No. 566) of last week.</p>
                <p>A copy of his lordship’s note is transmitted.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>CHARLES FRANCIS ADAMS.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wm. H. Seward</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >&amp;c</hi>.<hi rendition="#italic">, &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d33-a1.xml" xpointer="d33-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
